# When done with a task, remove it from [TODO.md](mdc:TODO.md)

- The user wants this file to be clean - it should only contain tasks that have not yet been performed.
- Do NOT remove other tasks than the one(s) you actually finished.

# After removing it from [TODO.md](mdc:TODO.md), commit and push your changes.

- Do not forget to read the [git-commit-rules.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/git-commit-rules.mdc) and the [git-no-pager.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/git-no-pager.mdc) and the [git-safety-rules.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/git-safety-rules.mdc).
- Your shell is PowerShell - read the rules [use-powershell-syntax.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/use-powershell-syntax.mdc).